OL,3,GNEWSA'I might have to take a second
OL,4,Ajob' - the impact of rising inflation
OL,5,
OL,6,FA mum has told how she may need to take
OL,7,Fa second job just to combat the rising
OL,8,Fcost of living.
OL,10,FEmma Ashfield works full-time, but said
OL,11,Fgrowing financial pressures were a
OL,12,Fconstant worry and can make raising a
OL,13,Fchild "extremely expensive".
OL,15,FThe latest figure from the Office for
OL,16,FNational Statistics (ONS) on Wednesday
OL,17,Findicated that inflation rose to 3.1%.
OL,19,FIt marks a rise from 2.9% in July,
OL,20,Fwhich was the highest rate for four
OL,21,Fmonths and above the Bank of England's
OL,22,F2% target.
